//@version=6
indicator("vw-w1-drawing-levels", overlay = true)

// PROVENANCE: written 2026-11-07 for the Pine parity programme from the inline shape in
// docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-11-02-w1.md, W1-D (rows D01-D03 on RDDT, D01-D03 on SPY). The code below these comments is that doc's text.
// NEVER COMPILED ON TRADINGVIEW: a line that does not compile IS a reading - record the error text and the line.
// QUESTION: ta.obv / ta.pvt / ta.wad printed in a last-bar table cell (ours refuses them by name on every drawing door: pine:window-dependent). Read the three cell texts.
// CAPTURE: NYSE:RDDT 1D FROM THE LISTING, and AMEX:SPY 1D (NOT from the listing): two captures.

var table t = table.new(position.top_right, 1, 3)
if barstate.islast
    table.cell(t, 0, 0, str.tostring(ta.obv))
    table.cell(t, 0, 1, str.tostring(ta.pvt))
    table.cell(t, 0, 2, str.tostring(ta.wad))
